Demolition Dome:
The Demolition Dome  is an arena in the Undermine. It is guarded by the world boss, The Gobfather.
The arena appears in several instances:

in the Liberation of Undermine raid, where the Cauldron of Carnage encounter plays out;
the Cage of Carnage PvP arena;
it serves as the challenge delve for The Underpin;
rebranded as the Dastardly Dome, it is the place where the limited-time Dastardly Duos event takes place.
